<view class="page scan-page">
  <view class="mode-tabs card">
    <button class="mode-tab {{mode === 'bind' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="bind"
      disabled="{{busy || scanning}}" bindtap="changeMode">绑定平台账号</button>
    <button class="mode-tab {{mode === 'pc' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="pc"
      disabled="{{busy || scanning}}" bindtap="changeMode">电脑扫码登录</button>
  </view>
  <view class="scan-hero">
    <view class="scan-symbol">⌗</view>
    <text class="page-title">{{mode === 'pc' ? '确认电脑端登录' : '绑定本人平台账号'}}</text>
    <text class="page-subtitle">{{mode === 'pc' ? '扫描电脑登录页的动态二维码，核对后再确认。' : '首次使用请扫描管理员为本人生成的账号二维码。'}}</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!configured}}" class="connection-note">服务尚未接入，暂不能完成账号绑定或电脑登录。</view>
  <view class="scan-card card">
    <block wx:if="{{!pcReady && !pcDone && !pcCancelled}}">
      <view class="scan-frame">
        <view class="corner corner-tl"></view><view class="corner corner-tr"></view>
        <view class="corner corner-bl"></view><view class="corner corner-br"></view>
        <view class="scan-line"></view>
        <text class="scan-frame-text">{{mode === 'pc' ? '扫描电脑动态二维码' : '扫描个人账号二维码'}}</text>
      </view>
      <button class="primary-button scan-button" bindtap="startScan"
        loading="{{busy || scanning}}" disabled="{{busy || scanning}}">打开扫一扫</button>
    </block>

    <view wx:if="{{mode === 'bind' && userNo}}" class="scan-result">
      <text class="result-label">识别到的平台账号</text>
      <text class="result-value">{{userNo}}</text>
      <button class="secondary-button confirm-button" bindtap="confirmBind" disabled="{{busy}}">确认绑定本人账号</button>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{pcReady}}" class="pc-request">
      <view class="pc-symbol">▣</view>
      <text class="pc-title">是否允许电脑登录？</text>
      <text class="pc-row">登录账号：{{accountName}}</text>
      <text class="pc-row">设备：{{deviceName}}</text>
      <text class="pc-row">位置：{{location}}</text>
      <text class="countdown">请在 {{secondsLeft}} 秒内处理</text>
      <text class="pc-warning">仅确认本人发起的登录；设备或位置不符时请拒绝。</text>
      <button class="primary-button confirm-button" disabled="{{busy || secondsLeft === 0}}" bindtap="confirmPc">确认登录</button>
      <button class="secondary-button confirm-button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="cancelPc">拒绝登录</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{pcDone || pcCancelled}}" class="pc-request">
      <view class="pc-symbol">{{pcDone ? '✓' : '—'}}</view>
      <text class="pc-title">{{pcDone ? '已确认电脑登录' : '已拒绝本次登录'}}</text>
      <text class="page-subtitle">{{pcDone ? '请返回电脑端继续使用。' : '本次请求已取消，新的登录请求请重新扫码。'}}</text>
      <button class="secondary-button confirm-button" bindtap="startScan">扫描其他二维码</button>
    </view>
    <request-state wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" status="loading" />
  </view>
  <request-state wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" status="error" message="{{message}}"
    retry-text="重新扫码" bind:retry="retry" />
  <view class="tips card">
    <text class="tips-title">{{mode === 'pc' ? '电脑登录须知' : '绑定须知'}}</text>
    <block wx:if="{{mode === 'pc'}}">
      <view class="tip-item"><text class="tip-number">1</text><text>先登录小程序，再扫描电脑登录页展示的二维码。</text></view>
      <view class="tip-item"><text class="tip-number">2</text><text>二维码短时有效且只能使用一次，过期后请在电脑端刷新。</text></view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="tip-item"><text class="tip-number">1</text><text>二维码只包含平台用户编号，请确认属于本人。</text></view>
      <view class="tip-item"><text class="tip-number">2</text><text>重绑其他账号，请联系管理员解除原绑定关系。</text></view>
    </block>
    <button class="secondary-button confirm-button" disabled="{{busy || scanning}}" bindtap="goProfile">前往个人中心</button>
  </view>
</view>
